        <div class="after"><span>DirectApply</span><strong>{t('训练 Δ → 下一轮直接用', 'train Δ → apply it to the next state')}</strong><p>{t('不再用 GDR 做第二次否决。这样才能直接问：44→7 的筛选到底帮助了长期学习，还是限制了它？', 'There is no second GDR veto. This directly tests whether the 44→7 filtering helped long-term learning or constrained it.')}</p></div>
