        <li><span>02</span><strong>{t('checkpoint、W&B、Hugging Face 归档', 'checkpoint, W&B, and Hugging Face archival')}</strong><p>{t('训练过程、loss、候选更新和可恢复资产分开保存，方便事后重放与核对。', 'Keep training curves, losses, candidate updates, and recoverable assets separately archived for replay and verification.')}</p></li>
